    "description": "Watchtower, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Log watchtower: spiral stair inside four posts up to a railed lookout (floor at y 4), hip roof; L2 walls the base with arrow slits, awning and bell; L3 adds a pointed cap with a flag. 4 x 4 core, not 3 x 3 (a walkable stair needs it). Not yet builder-tested: bell, red_wall_banner, white_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern.",
